  "text": "Sabrent 4TB Rocket 5 M.2 PCIe Gen 5 NVMe SSD/Solid State Drive LN146944 - SB-RKT5-4TB | SCAN UK BACK Hello, we are SCAN SITE FEEDBACK Scan.co.uk Award winning Systems and customer service Trustpilot 4.8 rating on Trustpilot From over 50,000 customer reviews PayPal Credit 0% interest up to 4 months Minimum spend applies from £99 Deliver To Inc VAT BUSINESS LOGIN HELP CENTER Home Computer Hardware Solid State Drives M.2 PCIe 5.0 NVMe Sabrent 4TB Rocket 5 M.2 PCIe End Of Life Sabrent 4TB Rocket 5 M.2 PCIe Gen 5 NVMe SSD/Solid State Drive Scan code: LN146944 Manufacturer code: SB-RKT5-4TB End Of Life Product Overview Warranty Buying Guide Reviews Q & A zoom End Of Life Sabrent 4TB Rocket 5 M.2 PCIe Gen 5 NVMe SSD/Solid State Drive 4TB Sabrent Rocket 5, M.2 (2280) PCIe 5.0 (x4), NVMe SSD, 14,000MB/s Read, 12,000MB/s Write, 1400k/1400k IOPS MORE INFO MORE INFO Scan code: LN146944 Manufacturer code: SB-RKT5-4TB End of life No customer review This product is no longer available to purchase. Product Details Product Overview Warranty Buying Guide Reviews Q & A Product Overview Here to Deliver! You're ready for something new. We're here to deliver. Our freshest, super-fast SSD, the Rocket 5, is finally here. The popular Rocket 4 Plus and gaming-inspired Rocket 4 Plus-G pushed the limits of what had once been possible. Now you can transcend with full PCIe 5.0 bandwidth, enjoying transfer speeds of up to 14 GB/s to supercharge your workflow. Cutting-edge games, high-end applications, and large-project file operations will never be the same again. Enhance your desktop experience with a carefully designed, DirectStorage-optimized storage solution made with your valuable time in mind. Features Our Fastest SSD Ever Take your storage performance to the next level with the Sabrent Rocket 5, the natural successor to our award-winning Rocket 4 Plus and gaming-inspired Rocket 4 Plus-G. This fresh hardware uses the latest storage technology to reach all-new heights. With Big Speed Comes Big Capacity Available at up to 4TB at launch and later 8TB, you will be able to transfer lots of data fast and never run out of space. Put your favourite games, applications, and often-accessed files on the most capable storage possible with the Rocket 5. Never Get Left Behind Enjoy transfers at up to an astounding 14GB/s or more, making the best use of PCIe 5.0 bandwidth. The DirectStorage-optimized firmware also makes sure you're always at the top of your game, backed by ample DRAM, the newest NAND flash, and a powerful eight-channel controller. Business or Pleasure Improve your workflow and increase your productivity with the fastest transfer speeds imaginable. The reliable, backward-compatible Rocket 5 is optimally balanced for content creation, high-end applications, and more. Stylishly Cool Design Get the drive on its own or with a custom heatsink. You can supply your own heatsink or invest in our separate high-end cooling solution, which uses top-grade materials and dual heatpipes for maximum thermal dissipation. Warranty Please note your statutory rights are not affected. For further information regarding Scan's warranty procedure please see our terms and conditions Details Duration: 12 months Type: Return to base DOA Period: 6 days RTB Period: 12 months Manufacturer Contact Details Manufacturer: warranty 1 year standard, 5 years with registration within 90 days of purchase Telephone: please registration is made within 90 days of purchase Buying Guide Need help? Read our Internal Storage Buying Guide Back Sabrent 4TB Rocket 5 M.2 PCIe Gen 5 NVMe SSD/Solid State Drive Share",
